DECladebug comes with a graphical user interface which at this time
is only available from FUSE.  FUSE would be the commercial development
environment on the Digital Unix platform.  The next major release of
Digital Unix will come with the decladebugui (the graphical debugger)
as part of the base system, rather than as an add-on via FUSE.  You will
still need the development license, but if you are not developing, you
don't really need the debugger anyway.

